<section class="source-text source-copy project-section" style="--source-space:96px;--source-height:132px" data-source-section="1114:617"><div data-node-id="1112:497" data-name="RO / Work Detail / Copy Block / Desktop" class="content-stretch flex gap-[60px] items-start min-h-[132px] relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><div data-node-id="1112:493" data-name="Label" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[330px]"><p data-node-id="1112:494" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-bold font-bold leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:12px] tracking-[0.96px] uppercase w-[300px]">NATURAL RESISTANCE</p></div><div data-node-id="1112:495" data-name="Copy" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[954px]"><p data-node-id="1112:496" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]">The direction brings together revolutionary poster art, street and activewear culture, and lush green nature. Direct language and strong compositions give the environmental idea the presence of a campaign.</p></div></div></section>
<SourceComposition width={1344} height={497} spaceBefore={96} sourceNode="1486:2091" wide={false} align="center"><div data-node-id="1486:2091" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative shrink-0 w-full"><div data-node-id="1486:2092" class="content-stretch flex items-start relative shrink-0 w-full"><div data-node-id="1486:2093" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Bebas_Neue'] leading-[0] not-italic relative shrink-0 text-[68px] text-black text-center tracking-[0.68px] w-[1344px]"><p class="leading-[1.05] mb-0">&quot;I've never experienced a partnership like it. Jason listened intently, interpreted it perfectly and delivered on it immediately. Taking the brand into territory we had only dreamt of. His vision. His creativity. His delivery of the creativity and his deep understanding of human nature are just some of his super powers.&quot;</p><p class="leading-[1.05]">​</p></div></div></div></SourceComposition>
<section class="source-text source-copy project-section" style="--source-space:96px;--source-height:99px" data-source-section="1114:622"><div data-node-id="1112:497" data-name="RO / Work Detail / Copy Block / Desktop" class="content-stretch flex gap-[60px] items-start min-h-[99px] relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><div data-node-id="1112:493" data-name="Label" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[330px]"><p data-node-id="1112:494" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-bold font-bold leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:12px] tracking-[0.96px] uppercase w-[300px]">THE DIGITAL EXPERIENCE</p></div><div data-node-id="1112:495" data-name="Copy" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[954px]"><p data-node-id="1112:496" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]">The website brings the proposition into one place: what EARNT stands for, how people take part and what participation makes possible. The design carries the campaign’s energy into a clear introduction to the platform.</p></div></div></section>
