<section class="source-text source-copy project-section" style="--source-space:96px;--source-height:132px" data-source-section="1114:632"><div data-node-id="1112:497" data-name="RO / Work Detail / Copy Block / Desktop" class="content-stretch flex gap-[60px] items-start min-h-[132px] relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><div data-node-id="1112:493" data-name="Label" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[330px]"><p data-node-id="1112:494" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-bold font-bold leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:12px] tracking-[0.96px] uppercase w-[300px]">THE BRAND WORLD</p></div><div data-node-id="1112:495" data-name="Copy" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[954px]"><p data-node-id="1112:496" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]">Poster-like compositions, fashion references and botanical imagery establish the direction. Their relationship carries the idea: collective action with cultural energy and an unmistakable connection to nature.</p></div></div></section>
<SourceComposition width={1344} height={650} spaceBefore={96} sourceNode="1088:2006" wide={false} align="center"><div data-node-id="1088:2006" data-name="Campaign language / Natural Resistance" class="bg-[#f4f4f4] content-stretch flex flex-col gap-[28px] h-[650px] items-start overflow-clip py-[64px] relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><div data-node-id="1088:2007" data-name="Divider" class="h-px relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><img alt="" src="/assets/parity/1088-1758-6854e.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full"></div><p data-node-id="1088:2008" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-bold font-bold leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[#0a0a0a] text-[length:12px] tracking-[0.96px] uppercase w-[500px]">CAMPAIGN LANGUAGE — NATURAL RESISTANCE</p><p data-node-id="1088:2009" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.1] relative shrink-0 text-[#0a0a0a] text-[36px] w-[1100px]">A revolution in consumption.</p><p data-node-id="1088:2010" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[#0a0a0a] text-[length:16px] w-[1180px]">THE WORLD AS YOUR PLAYGROUND · EARN YOUR STRIPES · ACTIONS SPEAK LOUDER THAN MONEY</p><p data-node-id="1088:2011" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[920px]">The type and image language borrowed the urgency of activist posters without becoming didactic. Strong composition, direct statements and culturally familiar styling gave a serious environmental mission the energy of a movement people could choose to join.</p><p data-node-id="1088:2012" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[0.9] relative shrink-0 text-[#0a0a0a] text-[160px] w-[400px]">Aa</p></div></SourceComposition>
<section class="source-text source-copy project-section" style="--source-space:96px;--source-height:99px" data-source-section="1114:637"><div data-node-id="1112:497" data-name="RO / Work Detail / Copy Block / Desktop" class="content-stretch flex gap-[60px] items-start min-h-[99px] relative shrink-0 w-[1344px]"><div data-node-id="1112:493" data-name="Label" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[330px]"><p data-node-id="1112:494" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-bold font-bold leading-[1.6] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:12px] tracking-[0.96px] uppercase w-[300px]">EARN YOUR STRIPES</p></div><div data-node-id="1112:495" data-name="Copy" class="content-stretch flex flex-col items-start relative self-stretch shrink-0 w-[954px]"><p data-node-id="1112:496" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[1.5] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]">Merchandise was conceived as a reward for taking part. The tiger becomes a sign of participation, extending the campaign beyond the screen into something people can wear.</p></div></div></section>
